
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>VHVR | Futuristic Dashboard</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#080b18;color:#f3f5ff}
header{padding:22px 7%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #252b48;background:#0c1022}
.logo{font-size:23px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:3px;color:#8d9cff}
nav a{color:#c9d0ef;text-decoration:none;margin-left:16px;font-size:14px}
main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:48px 6%}
.hero{padding:35px 0 45px}
.tag{color:#9c8cff;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:3px}
h1{font-size:clamp(36px,8vw,64px);margin:16px 0;line-height:1.08}
h1 span{color:#8998ff}
p{color:#aab3d2;line-height:1.8}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#5865f2,#9b5de5);color:white;padding:13px 21px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;margin-top:12px}
.section-title{margin-top:35px;font-size:25px}
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:17px;margin-top:20px}
.card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#151b34,#0e1225);border:1px solid #293354;border-radius:16px;padding:22px}
.card .icon{font-size:28px}
.card h3{margin-bottom:8px}
.status{display:inline-block;color:#77f2c0;background:#12372f;padding:7px 11px;border-radius:20px;font-size:12px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:30px;color:#7782a7;border-top:1px solid #252b48;margin-top:55px;font-size:13px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="logo">VHVR<span style="color:white">.</span></div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Beranda</a>
    <a href="#fitur">Fitur</a>
    <a href="#tentang">Tentang</a>
  </nav>
</header>
<main>
  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="tag">NEXT GENERATION DIGITAL EXPERIENCE</div>
    <h1>Selamat datang di<br><span>VHVR WEB APP</span></h1>
    <p>Dashboard digital dengan desain futuristik, sederhana, dan modern. Bangun pengalaman baru bersama VHVR.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="#fitur">Jelajahi Fitur ↗</a>
  </section>

  <div class="status">● WEBSITE ONLINE</div>
  <h2 class="section-title" id="fitur">Fitur Utama</h2>
  <div class="cards">
    <article class="card">
      <div class="icon">🤖</div>
      <h3>VHVR Telegram Bot</h3>
      <p>Area untuk pengembangan bot Telegram dan perintah otomatis.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <div class="icon">⚡</div>
      <h3>Respons Cepat</h3>
      <p>Rancang pengalaman pengguna yang ringan dan mudah digunakan.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <div class="icon">🌌</div>
      <h3>Desain Futuristik</h3>
      <p>Tampilan gelap dengan aksen neon biru dan ungu yang responsif.</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title" id="tentang">Tentang VHVR</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>VHVR Digital Experience</h3>
    <p>Website ini adalah halaman depan VHVR. Integrasi backend, database, dan respons bot Telegram perlu dikonfigurasi secara terpisah.</p>
  </div>
</main>
<footer>© 2026 VHVR WEB APP · Dibuat untuk pengalaman digital yang lebih modern</footer>
</body>
</html>
